// GalBox-authored M2b negative probe (NOT from upstream).
// A deliberately wrong autoPath must make the short name unresolvable.
// If the host silently falls back to the loose basename lookup, this script
// would "succeed" and test_m2b.cpp would fail -- which is the point:
// Storages resolution must be strict, and execStorage must not treat a
// missing .tjs as an empty script that executed cleanly.
Storages.addAutoPath("missing_dir/");
Scripts.execStorage("Utils.tjs");
